WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.455
You found a bug.

2
00:00:01.455 --> 00:00:07.125
Typing it out for your AI agent takes a paragraph, and it still misses what you saw.

3
00:00:07.543 --> 00:00:09.530
With Luna, you just show it.

4
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:13.538
Press Command Option 1 and drag over the part that matters.

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.980
Then talk it through, the way you would with a teammate.

6
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.638
When I click Pay, nothing happens.

7
00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:22.705
Press Command Option S to stop.

8
00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:27.025
Luna saves a small video and copies the path and context.

9
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.917
Paste it into your agent.

10
00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:33.300
It gets the file, what you said, and every click with a timestamp.

11
00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:38.509
Luna is free and open source.

12
00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:40.422
On Mac today, Windows soon.

13
00:00:40.422 --> 00:00:43.442
Get it at luna.nimit.dev.
